{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "mern-chat-app-collection",
		"name": "MERN Chat App API",
		"description": "Complete API collection for MERN Chat Application.\n\n## ⚠️ IMPORTANT: Testing Order\n\n**You MUST run requests in this order:**\n1. **Login** or **Sign Up** first (to get JWT cookie)\n2. **Get Users for Sidebar** (to populate target_user_id)\n3. Then test other endpoints\n\n## Authentication\nThis API uses **JWT tokens stored in cookies** for authentication. After login or signup, the JWT token is automatically set as an HTTP-only cookie.\n\n## Base URL\n- Production: `https://mern-chat-app-qimf.onrender.com`\n- Development: `http://localhost:5001`\n\n## Endpoints Overview\n\n### Authentication (`/api/auth`)\n- **POST** `/signup` - Register new user\n- **POST** `/login` - Login existing user\n- **POST** `/logout` - Logout user\n- **PUT** `/update-profile` - Update user profile picture (Protected)\n- **GET** `/check` - Check authentication status (Protected)\n\n### Messages (`/api/messages`)\n- **GET** `/users` - Get all users for sidebar (Protected)\n- **GET** `/:id` - Get messages with specific user (Protected)\n- **POST** `/send/:id` - Send message to user (Protected)",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "https://mern-chat-app-qimf.onrender.com",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "Base URL for the API server"
		},
		{
			"key": "user_id",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "Current logged-in user ID (auto-populated after login)"
		},
		{
			"key": "target_user_id",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "Target user ID for messaging (auto-populated from Get Users)"
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Authentication",
			"description": "Authentication endpoints for user registration, login, logout, and profile management.\n\n**⚠️ Start here! Login or Sign Up first before testing other endpoints.**",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "1.1 Sign Up (New User)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"// Check if response is JSON",
									"const contentType = pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type') || '';",
									"const isJson = contentType.includes('application/json');",
									"",
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    pm.test('✅ Status code is 201 - Signup successful', function () {",
									"        pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
									"    });",
									"    ",
									"    pm.test('✅ Response has user data', function () {",
									"        const response = pm.response.json();",
									"        pm.expect(response).to.have.property('_id');",
									"        pm.expect(response).to.have.property('fullName');",
									"        pm.expect(response).to.have.property('email');",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', response._id);",
									"        console.log('✅ User ID saved:', response._id);",
									"    });",
									"} else if (pm.response.code === 400) {",
									"    pm.test('ℹ️ Signup failed (expected if email exists)', function () {",
									"        if (isJson) {",
									"            const response = pm.response.json();",
									"            console.log('Message:', response.message);",
									"        }",
									"        pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(400);",
									"    });",
									"} else {",
									"    pm.test('⚠️ Unexpected status code: ' + pm.response.code, function () {",
									"        console.log('Response:', pm.response.text());",
									"    });",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						},
						{
							"listen": "prerequest",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"// Generate unique email for testing",
									"const timestamp = Date.now();",
									"pm.variables.set('test_email', `testuser${timestamp}@example.com`);",
									"console.log('📧 Generated test email:', `testuser${timestamp}@example.com`);"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"fullName\": \"Test User\",\n    \"email\": \"{{test_email}}\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/signup",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"auth",
								"signup"
							]
						},
						"description": "Register a new user account.\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `fullName` (string, required): User's full name\n- `email` (string, required): User's email address (must be unique)\n- `password` (string, required): Password (minimum 6 characters)\n\n**Response (201 Created):**\n- `_id`: User's unique identifier\n- `fullName`: User's full name\n- `email`: User's email\n- `profilePic`: Profile picture URL (empty by default)\n\n**Errors:**\n- 400: All fields are required\n- 400: Password must be at least 6 characters\n- 400: Email already exists\n- 500: Internal Server Error"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "1.2 Login (Existing User) ⭐ START HERE",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"const contentType = pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type') || '';",
									"const isJson = contentType.includes('application/json');",
									"",
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    pm.test('✅ Status code is 200 - Login successful', function () {",
									"        pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"    });",
									"    ",
									"    pm.test('✅ Response has user data', function () {",
									"        const response = pm.response.json();",
									"        pm.expect(response).to.have.property('_id');",
									"        pm.expect(response).to.have.property('fullName');",
									"        pm.expect(response).to.have.property('email');",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', response._id);",
									"        console.log('✅ Logged in as:', response.fullName);",
									"        console.log('✅ User ID saved:', response._id);",
									"    });",
									"    ",
									"    pm.test('✅ JWT cookie should be set', function () {",
									"        // Note: HTTP-only cookies may not be visible in Postman",
									"        console.log('ℹ️ JWT cookie is set by server (HTTP-only)');",
									"    });",
									"} else if (pm.response.code === 400) {",
									"    pm.test('❌ Login failed - Invalid credentials', function () {",
									"        if (isJson) {",
									"            const response = pm.response.json();",
									"            console.log('❌ Error:', response.message);",
									"            console.log('💡 Tip: Make sure you have signed up first, or check email/password');",
									"        }",
									"        pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(400);",
									"    });",
									"} else {",
									"    pm.test('⚠️ Unexpected response: ' + pm.response.code, function () {",
									"        console.log('Response:', pm.response.text());",
									"    });",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"test@example.com\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"auth",
								"login"
							]
						},
						"description": "⭐ **START HERE** - Login with existing user credentials.\n\n**⚠️ IMPORTANT:** You must login first before testing protected endpoints!\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `email` (string, required): User's email address\n- `password` (string, required): User's password\n\n**Response (200 OK):**\n- `_id`: User's unique identifier\n- `fullName`: User's full name\n- `email`: User's email\n- `profilePic`: Profile picture URL\n\n**Errors:**\n- 400: Invalid credentials\n- 500: Internal Server Error\n\n**Note:** JWT token is set as HTTP-only cookie on successful login."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "1.3 Check Auth Status",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"const contentType = pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type') || '';",
									"const isJson = contentType.includes('application/json');",
									"",
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    pm.test('✅ Status code is 200 - Authenticated', function () {",
									"        pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"    });",
									"    ",
									"    pm.test('✅ Response has user data', function () {",
									"        const response = pm.response.json();",
									"        pm.expect(response).to.have.property('_id');",
									"        pm.expect(response).to.have.property('fullName');",
									"        console.log('✅ Authenticated as:', response.fullName);",
									"    });",
									"} else if (pm.response.code === 401) {",
									"    pm.test('⚠️ Status 401 - Not authenticated (login first!)', function () {",
									"        if (isJson) {",
									"            const response = pm.response.json();",
									"            console.log('❌ Error:', response.message);",
									"        }",
									"        console.log('💡 Tip: Run Login request first to get authenticated');",
									"        pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(401);",
									"    });",
									"} else {",
									"    pm.test('⚠️ Unexpected response: ' + pm.response.code, function () {",
									"        console.log('Response:', pm.response.text());",
									"    });",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/check",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"auth",
								"check"
							]
						},
						"description": "Check if the current user is authenticated.\n\n**Authentication Required:** Yes (JWT cookie)\n\n**Response (200 OK):**\n- `_id`: User's unique identifier\n- `fullName`: User's full name\n- `email`: User's email\n- `profilePic`: Profile picture URL\n\n**Errors:**\n- 401: Unauthorized - No Token Provided (login first!)\n- 401: Unauthorized - Invalid Token\n- 500: Internal Server Error"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "1.4 Update Profile Picture",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"const contentType = pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type') || '';",
									"const isJson = contentType.includes('application/json');",
									"",
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    pm.test('✅ Status code is 200 - Profile updated', function () {",
									"        pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"    });",
									"    ",
									"    pm.test('✅ Response has updated profilePic', function () {",
									"        const response = pm.response.json();",
									"        pm.expect(response).to.have.property('profilePic');",
									"        console.log('✅ New profile pic URL:', response.profilePic);",
									"    });",
									"} else if (pm.response.code === 401) {",
									"    pm.test('⚠️ Status 401 - Not authenticated', function () {",
									"        console.log('💡 Tip: Run Login request first');",
									"        pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(401);",
									"    });",
									"} else if (pm.response.code === 400) {",
									"    pm.test('ℹ️ Status 400 - Profile pic required', function () {",
									"        if (isJson) {",
									"            console.log('Message:', pm.response.json().message);",
									"        }",
									"    });",
									"} else {",
									"    pm.test('⚠️ Unexpected response: ' + pm.response.code, function () {",
									"        console.log('Response:', pm.response.text());",
									"    });",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"profilePic\": \"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNk+M9QDwADhgGAWjR9awAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==\"\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/update-profile",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"auth",
								"update-profile"
							]
						},
						"description": "Update the authenticated user's profile picture.\n\n**Authentication Required:** Yes (JWT cookie)\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `profilePic` (string, required): Base64 encoded image data\n\n**Response (200 OK):**\n- Returns updated user object with Cloudinary URL\n\n**Errors:**\n- 400: Profile pic is required\n- 401: Unauthorized - No Token Provided\n- 500: Internal server error"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "1.5 Logout",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"const contentType = pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type') || '';",
									"const isJson = contentType.includes('application/json');",
									"",
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    pm.test('✅ Status code is 200 - Logged out', function () {",
									"        pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"    });",
									"    ",
									"    pm.test('✅ Logout message received', function () {",
									"        if (isJson) {",
									"            const response = pm.response.json();",
									"            pm.expect(response.message).to.eql('Logged out successfully');",
									"            console.log('✅', response.message);",
									"        }",
									"    });",
									"    ",
									"    // Clear stored variables",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', '');",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set('target_user_id', '');",
									"} else {",
									"    pm.test('⚠️ Unexpected response: ' + pm.response.code, function () {",
									"        console.log('Response:', pm.response.text());",
									"    });",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": ""
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/logout",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"auth",
								"logout"
							]
						},
						"description": "Logout the current user by clearing the JWT cookie.\n\n**Response (200 OK):**\n- `message`: \"Logged out successfully\"\n\n**Note:** This clears the JWT cookie and you'll need to login again."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "2. Messages",
			"description": "Message endpoints for real-time chat functionality.\n\n**⚠️ IMPORTANT:** All endpoints require authentication. Run Login first!",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "2.1 Get Users for Sidebar ⭐ RUN AFTER LOGIN",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"const contentType = pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type') || '';",
									"const isJson = contentType.includes('application/json');",
									"",
									"if (pm.response.code === 200 && isJson) {",
									"    pm.test('✅ Status code is 200', function () {",
									"        pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"    });",
									"    ",
									"    const response = pm.response.json();",
									"    ",
									"    pm.test('✅ Response is an array', function () {",
									"        pm.expect(response).to.be.an('array');",
									"        console.log('📋 Found', response.length, 'users');",
									"    });",
									"    ",
									"    pm.test('✅ Users do not include password', function () {",
									"        if (response.length > 0) {",
									"            response.forEach(user => {",
									"                pm.expect(user).to.not.have.property('password');",
									"            });",
									"        }",
									"    });",
									"    ",
									"    // Auto-populate target_user_id for next requests",
									"    if (response.length > 0) {",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set('target_user_id', response[0]._id);",
									"        console.log('✅ target_user_id set to:', response[0]._id);",
									"        console.log('👤 Target user:', response[0].fullName);",
									"    } else {",
									"        console.log('⚠️ No other users found. Create another user to test messaging.');",
									"    }",
									"} else if (pm.response.code === 401) {",
									"    pm.test('⚠️ Status 401 - Not authenticated', function () {",
									"        if (isJson) {",
									"            console.log('❌ Error:', pm.response.json().message);",
									"        }",
									"        console.log('💡 Tip: Run Login request first!');",
									"        pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.equal(401);",
									"    });",
									"} else {",
									"    pm.test('⚠️ Unexpected response: ' + pm.response.code, function () {",
									"        console.log('Content-Type:', contentType);",
									"        console.log('Response:', pm.response.text().substring(0, 200));",
									"    });",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/messages/users",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"messages",
								"users"
							]
						},
						"description": "⭐ **RUN THIS AFTER LOGIN** - Get all users except yourself for the chat sidebar.\n\nThis will automatically set the `target_user_id` variable for messaging tests.\n\n**Authentication Required:** Yes (JWT cookie)\n\n**Response (200 OK):**\nArray of user objects (excluding passwords)\n\n**Errors:**\n- 401: Unauthorized - Login first!\n- 500: Internal server error"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "2.2 Get Messages with User",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "prerequest",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"const targetUserId = pm.collectionVariables.get('target_user_id');",
									"if (!targetUserId) {",
									"    console.log('⚠️ WARNING: target_user_id is empty!');",
									"    console.log('💡 Tip: Run \"Get Users for Sidebar\" first to auto-populate this variable.');",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						},
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"const contentType = pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type') || '';",
									"const isJson = contentType.includes('application/json');",
									"const targetUserId = pm.collectionVariables.get('target_user_id');",
									"",
									"// Check if target_user_id is set",
									"if (!targetUserId) {",
									"    pm.test('⚠️ target_user_id not set - run Get Users first', function () {",
									"        console.log('💡 Run \"Get Users for Sidebar\" request first');",
									"        pm.expect.fail('target_user_id is empty');",
									"    });",
									"} else if (pm.response.code === 200 && isJson) {",
									"    pm.test('✅ Status code is 200', function () {",
									"        pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"    });",
									"    ",
									"    const response = pm.response.json();",
									"    ",
									"    pm.test('✅ Response is an array', function () {",
									"        pm.expect(response).to.be.an('array');",
									"        console.log('💬 Found', response.length, 'messages');",
									"    });",
									"    ",
									"    if (response.length > 0) {",
									"        pm.test('✅ Messages have correct structure', function () {",
									"            response.forEach(msg => {",
									"                pm.expect(msg).to.have.property('_id');",
									"                pm.expect(msg).to.have.property('senderId');",
									"                pm.expect(msg).to.have.property('receiverId');",
									"            });",
									"        });",
									"    }",
									"} else if (pm.response.code === 401) {",
									"    pm.test('⚠️ Status 401 - Not authenticated', function () {",
									"        console.log('💡 Run Login request first!');",
									"    });",
									"} else {",
									"    pm.test('⚠️ Unexpected response: ' + pm.response.code, function () {",
									"        console.log('Response:', pm.response.text().substring(0, 200));",
									"    });",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/messages/{{target_user_id}}",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"api",
								"messages",
								"{{target_user_id}}"
							]
						},
						"description": "Get all messages between you and another user.\n\n**Prerequisites:**\n1. Login first\n2. Run \"Get Users for Sidebar\" to set target_user_id\n\n**Authentication Required:** Yes (JWT cookie)\n\n**URL Parameters:**\n- `id`: Target user's ID (auto-populated from Get Users)\n\n**Response (200 OK):**\nArray of message objects between the two users"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "2.3 Send Message (Text Only)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "prerequest",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"const targetUserId = pm.collectionVariables.get('target_user_id');",
									"if (!targetUserId) {",
									"    console.log('⚠️ WARNING: target_user_id is empty!');",
